      A ⟨π, hπP⟩ hπmax hπ0 hrk ↥(fieldBar q M') 𝒞.teleN 𝒞.teleM 𝒞.teleFbar hratBar 𝒞.teleChart hratF
      𝒞.teleAn 𝒞.teleAn' 𝒞.teleSrc 𝒞.teleTgt 𝒞.teleXs 𝒞.teleXt (𝒞.teleWidth ⟨π, hπP⟩)
